  "term": "HIV dementia",
  "definition": "HIV dementia is a brain and nervous system disorder linked to AIDS that can cause problems with concentration and memory, slowed hand movements, poor coordination, apathy, incontinence, and difficulty walking. It is associated with HIV-1 infection in the central nervous system.",
